ders actually emit top-N lists before aggregating metrics; (4) replace the invalid t-test with something appropriate for seed variability, such as reporting mean/std/CV only, confidence intervals, or using repeated-measures comparisons between algorithms across matched seeds."}', name='submit_review'), type='function')]))[/cyan]
